*Issue #, if available:*

*Description of changes:*

Adding the DEL() command (String command)

Example: 
```
// assuming key1 and key2 exist, while key "invalid" does not. 
Integer result = client.del(new String[] {"key1", "key2", "invalid"}).get();
assert result == 2;
```

