*Issue #, if available:*

*Description of changes:*

Adding the EXISTS() command (Generic command)

Example: 
```
// assuming key1 and key2 exist, while key "invalid" does not. 
// note: result will be 3 because key1 is listed twice
Integer result = client.exists(new String[] {"key1", "key2", "key1", "invalid"}).get();
assert result == 3L;
```

